  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In September 2021, Brig. Gen. Ahmed T. Williamson said the Marine Corps continues to research and seek opportunities to meet the Commandant’s Force Design for 2030. He also said he was honored to have an opportunity to examine how analytics and artificial intelligence can better support recruiting and retaining talented Marines.",
   "sids": [
